{
"dur": 50.26,
"lines": [
{
"i": 0,
"start": 0.06,
"end": 3.35,
"text": "This swirl in your chai hides a million-dollar question."
},
{
"i": 1,
"start": 4.09,
"end": 6.34,
"text": "Every drop in it follows one rule."
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 6.82,
"end": 7.92,
"text": "Navier-Stokes."
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 8.5,
"end": 11.99,
"text": "It's Newton's push-and-move law, written for liquids and air."
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 12.47,
"end": 13.4,
"text": "Pressure pushes."
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 13.68,
"end": 15.11,
"text": "Stickiness slows."
},
{
"i": 6,
"start": 15.48,
"end": 16.94,
"text": "Motion carries it along."
},
{
"i": 7,
"start": 17.63,
"end": 19.21,
"text": "We already use it every day."
},
{
"i": 8,
"start": 19.9,
"end": 20.46,
"text": "Planes."
},
{
"i": 9,
"start": 21.46,
"end": 21.84,
"text": "Weather."
},
{
"i": 10,
"start": 23.07,
"end": 23.98,
"text": "Blood in your heart."
},
{
"i": 11,
"start": 25.01,
"end": 26.57,
"text": "So what's worth a million?"
},
{
"i": 12,
"start": 27.26,
"end": 29.65,
"text": "Stretch a swirl, and it spins faster."
},
{
"i": 13,
"start": 30.02,
"end": 31.78,
"text": "Like a skater pulling her arms in."
},
{
"i": 14,
"start": 32.36,
"end": 35.26,
"text": "Could it spin infinitely fast, and break the maths?"
},
{
"i": 15,
"start": 35.69,
"end": 36.74,
"text": "Nobody could prove it."
},
{
"i": 16,
"start": 37.9,
"end": 43.16,
"text": "In September, OpenAI said its AI proved it can, with an outside push."
},
{
"i": 17,
"start": 43.61,
"end": 44.95,
"text": "Experts are still checking."
},
{
"i": 18,
"start": 45.79,
"end": 46.78,
"text": "Your chai is safe."
},
{
"i": 19,
"start": 47.19,
"end": 47.74,
"text": "The maths?"
},
{
"i": 20,
"start": 48.11,
"end": 48.8,
"text": "We'll see."
}
]
}